<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Mika — Your AI Career Mentor</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg-0:#0a0a23;
    --bg-1:#150b3d;
    --bg-2:#1e1152;
    --violet:#8b5cf6;
    --violet-2:#a78bfa;
    --cyan:#22d3ee;
    --pink:#f472b6;
    --amber:#fbbf24;
    --green:#34d399;
    --ink:#f4f2ff;
    --ink-dim:#b7b0e0;
    --ink-faint:#8a82b8;
    --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    --glass-brd:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    --radius-lg:26px;
    --radius-md:18px;
    --radius-sm:12px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(1100px 700px at 12% -10%, #3a2470 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(900px 600px at 105% 10%, #1c3a6b 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(800px 500px at 50% 115%, #4a1f5c 0%, transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-0), var(--bg-1) 45%, var(--bg-2));
    background-attachment:fixed;
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
  p{margin:0;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;}
  ::selection{background:var(--violet);color:white;}

  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}
  .view{display:none;}
  .view.active{display:block;animation:viewIn .5s ease both;}
  @keyframes viewIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

  /* ---------- glass ---------- */
  .glass{
    background:var(--glass);
    border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);
    backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
    border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
  }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
    padding:18px 0;
  }
  .nav-inner{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:12px 22px;border-radius:100px;
    background:rgba(15,10,40,0.55);
    border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);
    backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:700;font-size:19px;}
  .brand .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--cyan);}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-dim);}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    padding:12px 22px;border-radius:100px;border:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;
    transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, opacity .18s ease;
  }
  .btn:active{transform:scale(.97);}
  .btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(120deg, var(--violet), #c084fc 55%, var(--pink));
    color:white;box-shadow:0 8px 26px -6px rgba(139,92,246,.65);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 10px 32px -6px rgba(139,92,246,.85);transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .btn-ghost{
    background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);color:var(--ink);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
  .btn-block{width:100%;}
  .btn[disabled]{opacity:.45;pointer-events:none;}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{padding:70px 0 40px;}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 0.85fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;}
  .eyebrow-pill{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 15px;border-radius:100px;
    background:rgba(139,92,246,.14);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.35);
    font-size:13px;color:var(--violet-2);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .hero h1{font-size:56px;line-height:1.06;font-weight:700;}
  .hero h1 .grad{
    background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet-2) 60%,var(--pink));
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .hero-sub{margin-top:22px;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:480px;}
  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .stat-row{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:46px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .stat-chip{padding:14px 18px;min-width:140px;}
  .stat-chip .num{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:700;font-size:22px;}
  .stat-chip .lbl{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:2px;}

  /* mentor hero card */
  .mentor-hero-card{position:relative;padding:34px 26px 28px;text-align:center;}
  .mentor-hero-card .ring{
    position:absolute;inset:-40px;border-radius:50%;
    background:conic-gradient(from 0deg, var(--violet), var(--cyan), var(--pink), var(--violet));
    filter:blur(60px);opacity:.35;z-index:-1;
  }
  .mentor-name-tag{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:14px;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:100px;
    background:rgba(34,211,238,.12);border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.35);font-size:13px;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;
  }
  .pulse-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green);animation:pulse 1.6s infinite;}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:.35;}}
  .speech-bubble{
    margin-top:16px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:16px 16px 16px 4px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);
    font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);text-align:left;line-height:1.5;min-height:44px;
  }
  .avatar-float{animation:floaty 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
  @keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0px);}50%{transform:translateY(-12px);}}

  /* ---------- section titles ---------- */
  .section{padding:70px 0;}
  .section-head{max-width:600px;margin-bottom:44px;}
  .section-head .kicker{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:10px;display:block;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:34px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15;}
  .section-head p{margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink-dim);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;}

  /* feature cards */
  .feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;}
  .feature-card{padding:26px 24px;transition:transform .25s ease, border-color .25s ease;}
  .feature-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);}
  .feature-icon{
    width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .feature-card h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .feature-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.55;}

  /* how it works */
  .flow-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;}
  .flow-card{padding:22px 20px;position:relative;}
  .flow-num{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:700;font-size:26px;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.4px var(--violet-2);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .flow-card h4{font-size:15.5px;margin-bottom:7px;}
  .flow-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.5;}

  footer{padding:40px 0 60px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:13.5px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--glass-brd);margin-top:20px;}

  /* ---------- mentor floating widget (app views) ---------- */
  .mentor-dock{
    position:fixed;right:24px;bottom:24px;z-index:60;
    display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;max-width:min(340px,86vw);
  }
  .mentor-dock .bubble-wrap{padding:14px 16px;border-radius:18px 18px 4px 18px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;max-width:250px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
  .mentor-dock .avatar-sm{width:64px;height:64px;flex:none;}
  .mute-btn{
    position:absolute;top:-10px;right:-10px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--bg-1);border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }

  /* ---------- forms ---------- */
  .app-shell{padding:50px 0 120px;min-height:100vh;}
  .progress-track{height:6px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .progress-fill{height:100%;border-radius:100px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet));transition:width .5s ease;}
  .card-narrow{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:38px 36px;}
  .field{margin-bottom:22px;}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;}
  .field input[type=text]{
    width:100%;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;
  }
  .field input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--violet-2);outline-offset:1px;}
  .chip-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;}
  .chip{
    padding:9px 15px;border-radius:100px;border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);font-size:13.5px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);color:var(--ink-dim);transition:all .18s ease;
  }
  .chip:hover{border-color:var(--violet-2);color:var(--ink);}
  .chip.selected{
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--violet),var(--pink));color:white;border-color:transparent;font-weight:600;
  }
  .goal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}
  .goal-card{padding:18px;text-align:left;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);transition:all .2s ease;}
  .goal-card:hover{border-color:var(--violet-2);}
  .goal-card.selected{border-color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(34,211,238,.09);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--cyan) inset;}
  .goal-card .emoji{font-size:24px;}
  .goal-card h4{font-size:15px;margin:10px 0 4px;}
  .goal-card p{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);line-height:1.4;}

  /* ---------- quiz ---------- */
  .quiz-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .quiz-skill-tag{
    display:inline-block;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;
    background:rgba(139,92,246,.16);color:var(--violet-2);margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .q-count{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .quiz-question{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Space Grotesk';line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:26px;}
  .option{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:15px 18px;border-radius:14px;
    border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);margin-bottom:12px;
    transition:all .18s ease;font-size:14.5px;
  }
  .option:hover{border-color:var(--violet-2);background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);}
  .option .letter{
    width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;flex:none;
  }
  .option.chosen{border-color:var(--violet-2);background:rgba(139,92,246,.16);}
  .option.correct{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(52,211,153,.14);}
  .option.wrong{border-color:#f87171;background:rgba(248,113,113,.14);}
  .option[disabled]{pointer-events:none;}

  /* ---------- results ---------- */
  .results-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:start;}
  .score-ring-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:30px 20px;}
  .score-big{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:46px;font-weight:700;}
  .skill-bar-row{margin-bottom:16px;}
  .skill-bar-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .skill-bar-top .val{color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .skill-bar-track{height:9px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;}
  .skill-bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:100px;width:0%;transition:width 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);}
  .tag-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin:3px 6px 3px 0;}
  .tag-strength{background:rgba(52,211,153,.14);color:var(--green);}
  .tag-gap{background:rgba(248,113,113,.14);color:#f87171;}

  /* ---------- roadmap timeline ---------- */
  .timeline{position:relative;margin-top:10px;padding-left:34px;}
  .timeline::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:12px;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet),var(--pink));}
  .tl-item{position:relative;padding-bottom:34px;}
  .tl-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}
  .tl-dot{
    position:absolute;left:-34px;top:2px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--bg-1);border:2px solid var(--violet-2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;
  }
  .tl-item.mastered .tl-dot{border-color:var(--green);background:var(--green);color:#052e1c;}
  .tl-card{padding:20px 22px;}
  .tl-tier{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .tl-card h4{font-size:16.5px;margin:6px 0 10px;font-family:'Space Grotesk';}
  .tl-tasks{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .tl-tasks li{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-dim);display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.45;}
  .tl-tasks li .chk{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--glass-brd);flex:none;margin-top:2px;}
  .tl-meta{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;}
  .tl-meta span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:100px;}

  .badge-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:16px;}
  .badge{padding:18px 12px;text-align:center;opacity:.35;filter:grayscale(1);transition:all .3s ease;}
  .badge.unlocked{opacity:1;filter:none;}
  .badge .b-emoji{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .badge h5{font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .badge p{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);line-height:1.3;}

  .update-banner{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:24px;
    background:rgba(34,211,238,.12);border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.35);color:var(--cyan);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;
    animation:bannerIn .4s ease;
  }
  @keyframes bannerIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

  .toolbar-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-bottom:30px;}

  /* icons */
  .ic{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero h1{font-size:38px;}
    .hero-sub{max-width:100%;}
    .feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .flow-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .goal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .results-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    .badge-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .card-narrow{padding:28px 20px;}
    .mentor-dock{right:14px;bottom:14px;}
    .mentor-dock .bubble-wrap{max-width:190px;font-size:12.5px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ MENTOR FLOATING DOCK (shown on app views) ============ -->
<div class="mentor-dock" id="mentorDock" style="display:none;">
  <div class="bubble-wrap glass" id="dockBubble">Hi! I'm Mika.</div>
  <div style="position:relative;">
    <div class="avatar-sm">__AVATAR__</div>
    <button class="mute-btn" id="muteBtn" title="Toggle Mika's voice">__ICON_VOLUME__</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================= LANDING ============================= -->
<section class="view active" id="view-landing">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <div class="nav-inner">
        <div class="brand"><span class="dot"></span> Mika<span style="color:var(--ink-faint);font-weight:500;">.ai</span></div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#features">Features</a>
          <a href="#how">How it works</a>
          <a href="#badges-preview">Achievements</a>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goTo('profile')">Get started</button>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow-pill">__ICON_SPARK__ AI career mentor for students</span>
          <h1>Discover Your Skills.<br><span class="grad">Build Your Future.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-sub">Your AI-powered career mentor that understands where you are, tests what you actually know, and rebuilds your roadmap every time you learn something new.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goTo('profile')">__ICON_ROCKET__ Start my skill check</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="document.getElementById('how').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">See how it works</button>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <div class="stat-chip glass"><div class="num">3</div><div class="lbl">Career paths mapped</div></div>
            <div class="stat-chip glass"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="lbl">Adaptive to your answers</div></div>
            <div class="stat-chip glass"><div class="num">Live</div><div class="lbl">Roadmap, not a PDF</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mentor-hero-card glass">
          <div class="ring"></div>
          <div class="avatar-float" style="width:180px;height:180px;margin:0 auto;">__AVATAR__</div>
          <div class="mentor-name-tag"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> Mika — online now</div>
          <div class="speech-bubble">"Tell me your goal and I'll find exactly what's standing between you and it. No fluff, promise."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section" id="features">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="kicker">What Mika does</span>
        <h2>A mentor that actually measures you, not just motivates you.</h2>
        <p>Most career sites give you generic advice. Mika builds a picture of your real skill level, then keeps it updated as you grow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,.18);color:var(--violet-2);">__ICON_TARGET__</div>
          <h3>Goal-first onboarding</h3>
          <p>Tell Mika your current skills and the career you want. She scopes the exact skill map that role needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:rgba(34,211,238,.18);color:var(--cyan);">__ICON_CHAT__</div>
          <h3>AI-generated mock test</h3>
          <p>Mika asks targeted questions pulled from your goal's real skill areas — not a generic quiz bank.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:rgba(244,114,182,.18);color:var(--pink);">__ICON_CHART__</div>
          <h3>Live skill evaluation</h3>
          <p>See exactly where you're strong and where the gaps are, scored per skill in an animated breakdown.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:rgba(251,191,36,.18);color:var(--amber);">__ICON_MAP__</div>
          <h3>A roadmap that adapts</h3>
          <p>Every retest reorders your roadmap — weakest skills always rise to the top of what to do next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:rgba(52,211,153,.18);color:var(--green);">__ICON_BADGE__</div>
          <h3>Achievement badges</h3>
          <p>Progress feels like progress — unlock badges as you complete assessments and close gaps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:rgba(167,139,250,.18);color:var(--violet-2);">__ICON_MIC__</div>
          <h3>A mentor with a voice</h3>
          <p>Mika talks you through key moments — toggle her voice on or off anytime from the dock.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section" id="how">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="kicker">The flow</span>
        <h2>From "I don't know where I stand" to a roadmap, in four steps.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-grid">
        <div class="flow-card glass"><div class="flow-num">1</div><h4>Build your profile</h4><p>Name, education, current skills, and the career you're aiming for.</p></div>
        <div class="flow-card glass"><div class="flow-num">2</div><h4>Take Mika's mock test</h4><p>Short, goal-specific questions — every answer feeds your skill map.</p></div>
        <div class="flow-card glass"><div class="flow-num">3</div><h4>See your skill evaluation</h4><p>An honest, visual breakdown of strengths and gaps, scored live.</p></div>
